## Deprecation Notice This package has been dropped in favor of
[@svelte-put/popover](/docs/popover). `@svelte-put/popover` is a more generic
implementation that relies on [Popover
API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Popover_API), which has
landed in baseline in 2024 and provides better fallback for progressive
enhancement in case Javascript is not available. --- Happy migrating 😅

